{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"monkeyWie.Gopeed.Web","latestVersion":"1.9.3","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Open source, lightweight, native, supports (HTTP, BitTorrent, Magnet , etc.) for downloading.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Open source, lightweight, native, supports (HTTP, BitTorrent, Magnet , etc.) for downloading.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Gopeed (full name Go Speed), a high-speed downloader developed by Golang + Flutter, supports (HTTP, BitTorrent, Magnet) protocol, and supports all platforms. In addition to basic download functions, Gopeed is also a highly customizable downloader that supports implementing more features through integration with APIs or installation and development of extensions.","name":"Gopeed Web","packageUrl":"https://gopeed.com/","publisher":"monkeyWie","publisherUrl":"https://gopeed.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed/releases/tag/v1.9.3","tags":["download","downloader"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"开源、轻量、原生，支持（HTTP、BitTorrent、Magnet 等）协议下载。","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Gopeed（全称 Go Speed），直译过来中文名叫做够快下载器（不是狗屁下载器！），是一款由 Golang+Flutter 开发的高速下载器，支持（HTTP、BitTorrent、Magnet）协议下载，并且支持全平台使用。除了基本的下载功能外，Gopeed 还是一款高度可定制化的下载器，支持通过对接 APIs 或者安装和开发扩展来实现更多的功能。","name":"Gopeed Web","packageUrl":"https://gopeed.com/zh-CN","publisher":"monkeyWie","publisherUrl":"https://gopeed.com/zh-CN","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/GopeedLab/gopeed/releases/tag/v1.9.3","tags":["下载","下载器"]}},"longDescription":"Gopeed (full name Go Speed), a high-speed downloader developed by Golang + Flutter, supports (HTTP, BitTorrent, Magnet) protocol, and supports all platforms. In addition to ba